{"seq":1,"slug":"js-wasm-interop","title":"JavaScript 与 WebAssembly 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/js-wasm-interop","wordCount":952,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"javascript-与-webassembly-互操作\">JavaScript 与 WebAssembly 互操作</h1><p>浏览器中的 Wasm 模块不是独立运行的——它通过 JavaScript WebAssembly API 被加载、实例化和调用。理解这层互操作的机制是高效使用 Wasm 的关键：如何传递复杂数据、如何管理线性内存的生命周期、如何处理异步初始化。本篇从底层 API 到高层绑定模式，全面覆盖 JS-Wasm 交互的技术细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>JS-Wasm 互操作围绕三个机制构建：WebAssembly JavaScript API（加载/编译/实例化）、线性内存的 TypedArray 视图（JS 读写 Wasm 数据）、import 对象（宿主能力注入）。跨边界调用有固定开销（50-200ns），批量传递数据而非逐元素调用是性能优化的第一法则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"webassembly-javascript-api\">WebAssembly JavaScript API</h2><p>浏览器暴露的 <code>WebAssembly</code> 全局对象是与 Wasm 交互的唯一入口：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[fetch .wasm] --&gt; B[WebAssembly.compileStreaming&lt;br/&gt;流式编译]&#10;    B --&gt; C[WebAssembly.Module&lt;br/&gt;编译后的模块]&#10;    C --&gt; D[WebAssembly.instantiate&lt;br/&gt;实例化 + 注入 imports]&#10;    D --&gt; E[WebAssembly.Instance&lt;br/&gt;可调用的实例]&#10;    E --&gt; F[instance.exports.*&lt;br/&gt;调用导出函数]\">graph TB\n    A[fetch .wasm] --&gt; B[WebAssembly.compileStreaming&lt;br/&gt;流式编译]\n    B --&gt; C[WebAssembly.Module&lt;br/&gt;编译后的模块]\n    C --&gt; D[WebAssembly.instantiate&lt;br/&gt;实例化 + 注入 imports]\n    D --&gt; E[WebAssembly.Instance&lt;br/&gt;可调用的实例]\n    E --&gt; F[instance.exports.*&lt;br/&gt;调用导出函数]</pre><h3 id=\"核心对象\">核心对象</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>WebAssembly.Module</code></td>\n<td>编译后的字节码（可缓存、可跨 Worker 传递）</td>\n<td>长期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WebAssembly.Instance</code></td>\n<td>运行时实例（含内存、全局变量状态）</td>\n<td>随使用方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WebAssembly.Memory</code></td>\n<td>线性内存的 JS 视图</td>\n<td>与实例绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WebAssembly.Table</code></td>\n<td>间接调用表的 JS 视图</td>\n<td>与实例绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WebAssembly.Global</code></td>\n<td>全局变量的 JS 包装</td>\n<td>与实例绑定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"加载与实例化\">加载与实例化</h3><p>推荐使用流式编译（边下载边编译）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 最佳实践：流式编译 + 实例化一步到位&#10;const { instance, module } = await WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming(fetch(&#39;/compute.wasm&#39;), {&#10;  env: {&#10;    log: (ptr, len) =&gt; console.log(readString(ptr, len)),&#10;    abort: () =&gt; {&#10;      throw new Error(&#39;Wasm abort&#39;);&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 调用导出函数&#10;const result = instance.exports.compute(42);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最佳实践：流式编译 + 实例化一步到位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiateStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/compute.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  env: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ptr, len)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Wasm abort'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调用导出函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>instantiateStreaming</code> 相比 <code>instantiate(arrayBuffer)</code> 的优势：下载与编译并行，不需要完整下载完才开始编译，对大模块（&gt; 1MB）效果显著。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存交互模式\">内存交互模式</h2><p>Wasm 的线性内存在 JS 侧表现为 <code>ArrayBuffer</code>，可以通过 TypedArray 视图读写：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const memory = instance.exports.memory;&#10;const buffer = new Uint8Array(memory.buffer);&#10;&#10;// 读取 Wasm 写入的数据&#10;function readString(ptr, len) {&#10;  const bytes = buffer.slice(ptr, ptr + len);&#10;  return new TextDecoder().decode(bytes);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 向 Wasm 内存写入数据&#10;function writeString(str, ptr) {&#10;  const encoded = new TextEncoder().encode(str);&#10;  buffer.set(encoded, ptr);&#10;  return encoded.length;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance.exports.memory;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(memory.buffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 读取 Wasm 写入的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ptr, ptr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDecoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 向 Wasm 内存写入数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> writeString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> encoded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(str);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(encoded, ptr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoded.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"内存管理的三种模式\">内存管理的三种模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Wasm 管理内存</td>\n<td>Wasm 导出 <code>malloc</code>/<code>free</code>，JS 调用分配</td>\n<td>简单直接</td>\n<td>JS 需要手动释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享线性内存</td>\n<td>JS 创建 Memory 对象传入 Wasm</td>\n<td>灵活控制</td>\n<td>需要协调布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绑定层自动管理</td>\n<td>wasm-bindgen 自动处理</td>\n<td>零手动管理</td>\n<td>有拷贝开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"重要陷阱-memory-grow-使-typedarray-失效\">重要陷阱：memory.grow 使 TypedArray 失效</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const memory = instance.exports.memory;&#10;let view = new Uint8Array(memory.buffer);&#10;&#10;instance.exports.allocate_large(); // 可能触发 memory.grow&#10;&#10;// 危险！grow 后 buffer 可能已更换&#10;// view.buffer !== memory.buffer  → 读写的是旧缓冲区&#10;view = new Uint8Array(memory.buffer); // 必须重新创建视图\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance.exports.memory;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> view </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(memory.buffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">allocate_large</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可能触发 memory.grow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 危险！grow 后 buffer 可能已更换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// view.buffer !== memory.buffer  → 读写的是旧缓冲区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">view </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(memory.buffer); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必须重新创建视图</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是 Wasm 开发中最常见的 bug 之一。任何可能触发 <code>memory.grow</code> 的调用后，都必须重新获取 TypedArray 视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"import-对象设计模式\">Import 对象设计模式</h2><p>实例化时传入的 import 对象定义了 Wasm 模块可用的外部能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const imports = {&#10;  env: {&#10;    // 函数导入&#10;    random: () =&gt; Math.random(),&#10;    now: () =&gt; performance.now(),&#10;&#10;    // 内存导入&#10;    memory: new WebAssembly.Memory({ initial: 256, maximum: 65536 }),&#10;&#10;    // 表导入&#10;    table: new WebAssembly.Table({ initial: 10, element: &#39;anyfunc&#39; }),&#10;&#10;    // 全局变量导入&#10;    __stack_pointer: new WebAssembly.Global({ value: &#39;i32&#39;, mutable: true }, 65536),&#10;  },&#10;  wasi_snapshot_preview1: {&#10;    // WASI polyfill（如果模块需要）&#10;    fd_write: (fd, iovs, iovs_len, nwritten) =&gt; {&#10;      /* ... */&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> imports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  env: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 函数导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 内存导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    memory: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maximum: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65536</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 表导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    table: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--sh